#: scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83c6703ffc75c30e500879ff2a78f21ecf91f92173a61a6abecda351e4e4aadd
#. default-sha256: 64323a1aabb867544d709f272778cec8cb051afc44c87ead6abb0b930eb0e0ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Approximately a week had passed since then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aproximadamente uma semana se passou desde então."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 406622bc6f774e42f5b57e155fa04613818d4b33a442c9ca805fb1b289beb82b
#. default-sha256: 6fa5aa6c243ab02e226c290a3fb15497ff3ed095d739ee923b734d9a29f63229
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl was, as usual, spending her time in her room reading, staying inside "
"the house. ⟪k:1⟫Then, Maria barged in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A Garota de Cabelos Brancos estava, como sempre, passando o tempo em seu quarto lendo, "
"ficando dentro de casa. ⟪k:1⟫Então, Maria invadiu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9ea035762726f4dac0e875be0590c8d9739b042e59560700cf2ba56b974e1c4
#. default-sha256: d9e36e2e17f22e0c80da1b8b3173ad6e581c24ff77d85028e2b27de7b8324c29
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madame! ⟪k:4⟫Madame!⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ff0938891c52618592185af1066cbc06340e6e9717950d185dac63837b16093
#. default-sha256: 1a5b8890f9f33ef722edba9d4fecd75af9a906379d8939617fe382016c907357
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh my. You’re out of breath. What happened?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh Deus. Você está sem fôlego. O que aconteceu?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dae4b0446ae0edfa67b0c1c76fe32d8293943eeca2be482635a23a712276393f
#. default-sha256: b16441cbdb5611d0cbece27ff70b79aa7364df302e3c4b28ed50a1009577b8cc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“What happened” is we have a ⟪k:2⟫big problem⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Th-⟪k:6⟫The garden... ⟪k:7⟫"
"The rose garden!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“O que aconteceu” é que temos um ⟪k:2⟫grande problema⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫ O-⟪k:5⟫O jardim... "
"⟪k:6⟫O jardim de rosas!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b19f2da23d3eab6ec483ddc6807b3ec92e38a66e5b81466bcfcd0ec50192b7b
#. default-sha256: 1c2d426c8e5888ec4a1445806d5671f66b26299509fd0b7358ee646fb3870e1b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The garden...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O jardim...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e2c3c96a8b33bd12f02f07506829819923cd543c90fa3631b806bd046c3d983
#. default-sha256: d839a03bf72fe5a34fd3efbb1a29de281a046f522ed68a5be06ac48890400ded
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All the roses you put so much love and care into growing are being chopped down! We’ll "
"lose them all if we don’t hurry!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Todas as rosas que você colocou tanto amor e cuidado no cultivo estão sendo cortadas! "
"Vamos perdê-las todas se não nos apressarmos!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e99bb3e8e46cc72b262ee44c486f73b9b907837693ae33e1d07072e7ede91444
#. default-sha256: 5fe5d36542b112d1b7275b43037f4dace539f9f70d4cce66cfb8c380597ddd7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8125d43927620c3c2e756cc4351d2e8e885fadd116056a2495682c91b7db1f67
#. default-sha256: dbd363362a448159fc94108cb648f779c0eaffb3cdbec54b63050935aa75be22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Upon hearing the news, the White-Haired Girl dashed from her room and toward "
"the garden, with Maria following close behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ao ouvir a notícia, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos saiu correndo de seu quarto "
"em direção ao jardim, com Maria seguindo logo atrás."

#: scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db49b4cd67afb8885730fc953e4632464ff532f4f494e4875f24b153e27de4f6
#. default-sha256: fc4dede2c48b5a343bfbad4743fcea73ece49ee292c72519a332aa487af79d2d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When she arrived, she saw a dozen or so sweaty, rugged men at work, Jacopo "
"shouting orders."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quando ela chegou, viu cerca de uma dúzia de homens suados e robustos trabalhando, "
"Jacopo gritando ordens."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3974c4f3f31257c927c1a95f5c60da7d26c317a55c1d196509998951a3b4052
#. default-sha256: 6009b74297e46f16db902252cf55df57e27d40a95db66e087f08d8a325ebd054
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men clearly had no concept of how much a single flower was worth, no concern whatsoever "
"for their beauty..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os homens claramente não tinham noção do quanto valia uma única flor, nenhuma preocupação "
"com sua beleza..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b45c8fa1fb6e55b79a6554110303a9b6f58780c739f2c6d8b497439352bc8603
#. default-sha256: 7ad1a4bf13c01f5ab9913aea82191b1287e5910955508a60be526153d64e6413
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for they mercilessly, thoughtlessly hacked away at the shrubs like they were naught but "
"weeds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫pois eles impiedosamente, sem pensar, cortaram os arbustos como se não fossem nada além de "
"ervas daninhas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8d6d0e393cf21669824be5532a4fc1e541af7b7c70800d8ad95371144fbb1a7
#. default-sha256: f0c220bee0e351bb3d339b84467fef824e2212d24dc6328add00e9b110cb3e7b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each flower they tore from the earth extinguished another of the many lives the White-Haired "
"Girl had put so much time and effort into tending for."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cada flor que arrancavam da terra extinguia outra das muitas vidas que a Garota de Cabelos "
"Brancos dedicara tanto tempo e esforço para cuidar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04cb625d134001a25580e0aeb47a54b70e1c5855ee552ebe31da2f0e4b338661
#. default-sha256: 6619d51a4093aff1775802cbddaaf08ddd6b3d31fd2a0e35da87d2dc356f7d65
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, what are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, o que você está—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1f3cfbb5d72009994bc099f4909054abc2d953604619c64846c43c72ef8c9af
#. default-sha256: a76910f8ee423aaf51d69ab29c3d69fb12d9b098279c4e7087f13bd1a7c2b41a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, hello, Maria.⟪k:2⟫I didn’t expect you would come with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, olá, Maria.⟪k:2⟫Eu não esperava que você viesse com ela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59297a5a5eccf735211fd15aeeb1cd694e7a94d17ea8207b60ec0c5ecaaae0c2
#. default-sha256: 26cacabe471b3faa13ac7d628c276e6b8c928429395bef7f28b11a32a3b7e065
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫would you do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Por que... ⟪k:2⟫você faria..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4b44b76f8de2bbae59ba0f323282a4298913aef7ab450b498b4312d4565c3d6
#. default-sha256: 4b5a05b3aa8b0c2962a50a2ee20322b3150df0c9e2402453d583ee15632e4394
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why? Why, it goes without saying.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This house has no need of a garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Por quê? Ora, nem é preciso dizer.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Esta casa não precisa de um jardim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f268d7812af5a576cd84dc81e0711e25a5e775de71e793838a32028c130a78e
#. default-sha256: 2eda50d66d0bc501c0823311665c7b56b309c30ab16bbb01c815938ef260d2cf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Damn flowers have no place here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Might as well do something worthwhile with "
"the soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Malditas flores não têm lugar aqui.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Poderia muito bem fazer algo que valha a "
"pena com o solo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 162e1b125942cfd9e8f426b2148e9059b111abce0d4efeb3ded46571609cf637
#. default-sha256: 60cee5857b0e42c7a9971ae9ae4e8ac0601fbee5d9b9936ddf3b90224b5d40e7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A miniature railroad would be a better use of the space,⟪k:2⟫and certainly a great deal "
"easier on the eyes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I could even get my hands on some genuine wheels."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uma ferrovia em miniatura seria um melhor uso do espaço,⟪k:2⟫e certamente muito mais "
"agradável de se ver.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu poderia até colocar minhas mãos em algumas rodas genuínas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7676a58b349abd243b5621fafa2b274dc96599634d8bcf81b54057ed5384aaa6
#. default-sha256: b2d4c78bc331b97f304498e4b4006b897eb22dcef8d10f0d5d99fbf38801aa17
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The same wheels being used on the revolutionary transcontinental railroad. ⟪k:1⟫Ten or "
"twenty years down the line, they’ll be worth a fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As mesmas rodas usadas na revolucionária ferrovia transcontinental. ⟪k:1⟫Dez ou vinte anos "
"depois, elas valerão uma fortuna."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67906e45d4979bba4822c82bc9e6b6f4f63a204dcd3bb90d42d546f2b90a24ed
#. default-sha256: d8151c77861f8b3b582b9496d74b77b4ba3eaf7cfad89a8cfe34bdb45b680d06
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 877d8cebfb02b4638e708e9ca6520160a7ddff644be0dc8de5c24776ab05cf3e
#. default-sha256: d211277b6140c03bfb2d199b5a223bb8c26e67cadd4312266662c35158f5fa6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You know... ⟪k:2⟫how much this garden meant to me, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você sabe... ⟪k:2⟫o quanto esse jardim significa para mim, não sabe?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0586405ab3b59b90312e3229e085b4583a5abdf5be801c44b98b36a56bf4448
#. default-sha256: b10d82a68a4d62c3150b0936b91ec0a6453ec8e4e51fd231ecb20cc3c4dfeb9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d7b47276d0c79877ccec2a791ededfa49988683bce1afbe726f930ed97de97e
#. default-sha256: e6744e0cb2ba4d3f7f67b34204dd530fc087b64ec8efb73b7cab1b0ed0b81653
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did it honestly have no place here?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Flowers have a calming effect on people. "
"They give you peace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ele, honestamente, não tinha lugar aqui?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As flores têm um efeito calmante "
"sobre as pessoas. Elas te dão paz."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3aa44bfa94a6603e893ce48b9496c980519be095c13568a1aa08222564cc9eb2
#. default-sha256: 450e1a4ae3de73a6ea21b086a3fe3a747502bac7fba437d28aa2a0d99d3ab786
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They are not, by any means, worthless—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elas não são, de forma alguma, inúteis—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02b9b7155fdd2f485800ecaaec14da288459570fdc5f4cb598c399caafb54c41
#. default-sha256: db155e917fa281fbd986f063ef0e2d4b79c58cd4ad1a2d259ec61ee35e798972
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So you’re saying that white rose was your passive-aggressive way of telling me to “calm "
"down”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Então você está dizendo que a rosa branca foi sua maneira passiva-agressiva de me dizer "
"para me “acalmar”?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_17B55CEE_966A_4E2A_A7B5_113B47328E10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
