msgid "⟪k:0⟫“Are you truly that determined to rob me of my sanctuary?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\"Você está realmente tão determinado a roubar meu santuário?\""

#: scenario3:scenario3_CA1406A6_68E7_420E_8297_978A9FA34DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3ab4396db4fe618b8be5591c5e27f664a08b4cbe60d8dae5f1100743a5c5f3a
