msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CA1406A6_68E7_420E_8297_978A9FA34DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The words twirled around in her head, unable to make the final journey to her lips. She "
"stood there, looking down at her own feet as her husband marched off..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As palavras giraram em sua cabeça, incapazes de fazer a viagem final para seus lábios. Ela "
"ficou lá, olhando para seus próprios pés enquanto seu marido se afastava enervado..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EBA9086F_5D46_44D1_AFC2_6781C81A9E6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a47c7597f03911f13accd5adbc46a63b7a200b46442cf2076154b1c7a0670690
#. default-sha256: 2201af7d02658e26763e9389f0939a7ea041bbdaaac3457c5110c5373b09fca1
