msgid "⟪k:0⟫and listened to the screams of the roses being reaped."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e ouvia os gritos das rosas sendo ceifadas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_927E28C5_6C98_4A06_A65C_B8944EE19E6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b80b6fabc0aaac3ee332ce16fdea330c0bd3e5a28fc98344bc45ab5c06f33258
#. default-sha256: 5edc120876a8052c6fc71ab69d91e7cc4a054b5da318e0a5373d75512540d447
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_927E28C5_6C98_4A06_A65C_B8944EE19E6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫After being torn down by Jacopo, the garden reverted to a state of ruined desolation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Depois de ser destruído por Jacopo, o jardim voltou a um estado de arruinada desolação."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79874CDC_E128_434D_93B8_7FAC2FA40F2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 313c6f2c0c46e63cc6079eaae649e689ec8a7422cf361572b0ff856e414f05b8
#. default-sha256: 1863f29310c66035af12a23f1f5eb3e3c5f15da13d2c0be48060221b2f79aa8d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79874CDC_E128_434D_93B8_7FAC2FA40F2B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A shame, after all the work that went into restoring it to the beauty it had under the "
"flaxen-haired family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma pena, depois de todo o trabalho que deu para restaurar a beleza que tinha durante a era "
"da família de cabelos de linho."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFDAB351_6FD0_4860_BF80_181134F8729D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ee97dae8446f71eee3070115dd2f93b7f5e4c0d074fc238f74bdfea20680e55
#. default-sha256: 24f547c623c2655daec8897873d55df5b47636ff3ea4f8d802ca8496742a30e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFDAB351_6FD0_4860_BF80_181134F8729D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as Jacopo had said, in its place went scraps of metal, train wheels, prototype models, "
"carbon rods."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E, como Jacopo havia dito, em seu lugar ficaram pedaços de metal, rodas de trem, modelos "
"protótipos, hastes de carbono."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2352417E_64FD_4241_BDC4_5261059AA706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa5e6c630831a1e3c1530efd900d49bf11e6429a6a9ccc1f433cd272a397139d
#. default-sha256: 54c1d2964281a29ff2a70a7a16574e98861e99e7c591b95e5af497166a554fab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2352417E_64FD_4241_BDC4_5261059AA706"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫These items may have had value for him, but I certainly do not think it was worth robbing "
"his wife of a place that made her feel comfortable just so he could store them there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Esses itens podem ter tido valor para ele, mas certamente não acho que valeu a pena roubar "
"de sua esposa um lugar que a fazia se sentir confortável apenas para que ele pudesse guardá-los "
"lá."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B6CF7A65_EC65_4D7C_AF85_6AA49A616898
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5d7ffa1a6f9477270689370bf2c144b4be67ffcf4b62c923c63b26c6568ee07
#. default-sha256: 23be362c76ac5b8097b21160f556149e1e0cf5863341b172a2f2ba5a4d707cdf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B6CF7A65_EC65_4D7C_AF85_6AA49A616898"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Besides, I was rather fond of the rose garden myself.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The roses seemed to evoke a "
"sense of nostalgia in me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Além disso, eu mesma gostava bastante do jardim de rosas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As rosas pareciam evocar "
"uma sensação de nostalgia em mim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37511A7E_68F1_413D_A27E_340C4758AA23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfc1a5e30f8040696ae298e1ea2efdfe963873a77c7525813801066a76efc3c8
#. default-sha256: f0d58479265fc27d5d07b9510bfd97c6bbb4551a5c7412cdd052757d1994dc83
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37511A7E_68F1_413D_A27E_340C4758AA23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt as though, somewhere far beyond the edge of my memories,⟪k:1⟫I had seen another "
"garden of roses,⟪k:2⟫modest though it may have been."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sentia como se, em algum lugar muito além do limiar de minhas memórias,⟪k:1⟫eu tinha visto "
"outro jardim de rosas, por mais modesto que tenha sido."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E4E06865_5116_4472_9D00_B9C1BFAD32E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c22c51d75de0e928eb2daa45338df9003eedd3cd6bd5e0faf78648422cc74f6
#. default-sha256: 1ddda03923a45d6075b7818dcd8b1c01e102297ca9a3b716f00548f133a4dc0d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E4E06865_5116_4472_9D00_B9C1BFAD32E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I cannot remember when it was..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas não conseguia me lembrar de quando foi..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A7238012_6A5F_4D65_9EBB_8922D34F7E49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bf7800076bb5dc9d6b02a3e91e20d784911f10e167f53b93a47719dfba9b9e9
#. default-sha256: 6fd72e9198f47e618d94bdac8f7173413227e904bc650e13227b8f0c18f0815a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A7238012_6A5F_4D65_9EBB_8922D34F7E49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Does that come as a surprise to you? ⟪k:1⟫I am quite sure there are periods of the mansion’s "
"history of which I am not aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Isso é uma surpresa para você? ⟪k:1⟫Tenho certeza de que há períodos da história da mansão "
"dos quais não tenho conhecimento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F313D77A_1405_4E02_9BE3_D5837AFD3794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbb42f4eb7f94e57da3d38afdb79de5446a15f00f7b1c613efc5bad0decd8b6d
#. default-sha256: 9edca9db2873c6be38b791804690a71e4fd730148872d1ff216b5275a4a14af5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F313D77A_1405_4E02_9BE3_D5837AFD3794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But in any case, Jacopo had caused many people great pain in order to repurpose that garden "
"for himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas, de qualquer forma, Jacopo havia causado grande sofrimento a muitas pessoas para dar "
"novo propósito àquele jardim para si mesmo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8999b30b60c2ef9da785a307adaa36427873bd76d8712673c98bc5b0c8747e3
#. default-sha256: 28b9d096004b8856ce15c11ed6eb9333bcaa33b53db12f7f1e20a73388c6edb7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he continued to walk all over his wife. ⟪k:1⟫Whenever she tried to do something kind for "
"him, he would brush her off, saying, “That’s not your place.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E ele continuou a passar por cima de sua esposa. ⟪k:1⟫Sempre que ela tentava fazer algo "
"gentil por ele, ele a ignorava, dizendo, “Esse não é o seu lugar”."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fb198d624e1ba926846b39b63751e50cf16f8e0b72be24d5a5fb8484fa80a98
#. default-sha256: f9245db3c68befd3b12c4e8dcbfd914fba03059c3d4a5e9e7ba984f6b45fd64f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He paid no mind whatsoever to the looks of dejection that rose to her face each time he "
"rejected her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele não se importou nem um pouco com os olhares de desânimo que surgiram em seu rosto cada "
"vez que ele a rejeitava."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae6ed7cc245c0eea5670f571b10f6b491fc6e5af92349c5768c4022d4d67742f
#. default-sha256: 206253be91a8bce36e2ca55dc9eb860aec395e2b24d4ee56f66cddc7df96d8be
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was beginning to wonder if anything she had said about the man he had been a year earlier "
"was actually true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu estava começando a me perguntar se alguma coisa que ela disse sobre o homem que ele tinha "
"sido um ano antes era realmente verdade."

